<title>USA: USDA - PL480 pact with Jamaica for $10 mln rice.</title>
<headline>USDA - PL480 pact with Jamaica for $10 mln rice.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Thursday said Jamaica has signed an agreement under Public Law 480, Title 1, for the purchase of $10 million worth of U.S. rice during fiscal year (FY) 1997.</p>
<p>USDA said the action will provide financing for the purchase of about 25,000 tonnes of U.S. rice. The supply period is fiscal year 1997.</p>
</text>
